@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NewUser2",
  "email": "newUser2@gmail.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Get user (not found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/cdc4997b-9d9-4592-9efb-f304474cd761

### Get user (found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/49a56860-5070-4831-91b6-3811feba0035

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NewUser4",
  "email": "newUser4@gmail.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe1234!"
}

### Login (success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newUser4@gmail.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe1234!"
}

### Login (invalid credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newUser4@gmail.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Me (replace <TOKEN> with login token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Create product (replace <TOKEN> with login token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "T-Shirt",
  "description": "Cotton tee",
  "price": 19.99,
  "stock": 50
}

### List products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Get product by ID (replace <PRODUCT_ID> with actual product ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/<PRODUCT_ID>
